    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 896/2of November 07, 1995 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1903/63 of February 27,2015) which specifies the Faculties and the Departments of the Sabaragamuwa University of Sri Lanka, by the substitutionfor the item \u201cDepartment of Cartography, Photogrammetry, Remote Sensing and Geographic Information System\u201d appearingin Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Geomatics\u201d appearing in Column I of the Scheduleof the following item :-",
